## 4. Deduplication Architecture Verification

The Phase 2 experimental codebase implements **Architecture B / Candidate-Pool Post-Fusion Deduplication**:

```text
Semantic Candidate Pool (K=20) ┐
                              ├─► RRF Fusion (Weighted) ─► RRF Ranked List (K=20) ─► Parent Dedup Filter ─► Top-10 Output
BM25 Candidate Pool (K=20)    ┘
```

* **Tested Pipeline**: candidate retrieval $\rightarrow$ RRF scoring $\rightarrow$ parent deduplication on fused ranks $\rightarrow$ Top-10 selection.
* **Architectural Note**: Deduplication is applied **after** reciprocal rank fusion, preserving accurate fusion ranks before filtering.

